Z||000013||FieroLisa||12-05-2000||10:56 AM||||We don't know what we want anymore than you do! Although it's crafty and sort of cheap, the idea of the cheap earrings in nice box would work- assuming- she doesn't ever wander into that jewelry store at all. BUT if you do get cheap earrings, make sure they at least LOOK nice. nothing gaudy!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR>Other gifts, aw who knows. My christmas list this year: Lowering Kit (got it) Rims (um probably not going to happen) Window Tint (got it) and anything else anyone wants to get me for the Fiero.  <BR>But then again your g/f would probably laugh if you came home with a new shift knob for her. <BR>Don't know what to tell you. YOU know her interests, work on that. Ask the best friends, ask her parents if you know them well. Just be crafty about it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (For Sale)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/||||reg||1
